  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Number of ways of selecting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> balls out of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> balls without any restriction is <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math><br />Number of ways of selecting <math><mn>3</mn></math> balls such that no black ball is selected is&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Number of ways such that atleast one black ball is selected is <math> <mrow> <mmultiscripts> <mi>C</mi> <mprescripts></mprescripts> <none></none> <mn>9</mn> </mmultiscripts> <msub> <mrow></mrow> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mo>−</mo><mmultiscripts> <mi>C</mi> <mprescripts></mprescripts> <none></none> <mn>6</mn> </mmultiscripts> <msub> <mrow></mrow> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow> </math></p>",
